  "experimental_conditions": {
    "001": {
      "0": {
        "analysis": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(UNFLD)",
            "free_txt": [
              " To reconstruct the reaction cross section an",
              " iterative procedure for minimizing directed",
              " divergences was used with the step equal to 1 MeV.",
              "The yields of barium isomers as functions of the",
              " bremsstrahlung endpoint energies were obtained",
              " from the measurements of the ratios of the yields",
              " for the isomeric states and for the monitoring",
              " reaction."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "comment": [
          {
            "x4_code": null,
            "free_txt": [
              "The cross  section of (g,n) reactions in the range of",
              " the Giant Dipole Resonance,  leading to  the  ground",
              " and isomeric  states  h-11/2  in  odd isotopes of Ba",
              " with mass number A = 129 - 137,  are  presented.  An",
              " activation method of measurement has been used.  The",
              " dependence of the isomeric  ratio  on  g-energy  and",
              " mass number  of  the  isotopes  has  been  obtained.",
              " Different factors  influencing  the  value  of   the",
              " isomeric ratio are discussed."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "detector": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(GELI)",
            "free_txt": [
              " 60 cm***3 volume GE(LI)-detector."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "err-analys": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(DATA-ERR)",
            "free_txt": [
              " Mean-root-squares uncertainties are given."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "facility": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(MICRT,4ZZZDUB)",
            "free_txt": [
              " JINR MT-25 Micritron."
            ]
          }
        ],
